# StorePilot 4K demo — terminal segment (part of full video)
Output docs/assets/storepilot-terminal-4k.mp4

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 28
Set Width 3840
Set Height 2160
Set Padding 80
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 8ms
Set PlaybackSpeed 0.85

Type "# StorePilot CLI — live release snapshot (Plazario)"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 500ms

Type "export LOG_LEVEL=error && npm run demo"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 45s

Type "# MCP: execute_release_intent · dryRun true"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 400ms

Type "storepilot snapshot 2>/dev/null | head -50"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 18s
